Make apclientpp build as C++11 with the GCC 4.8 libstdc++.

Hyperspace builds with --gcc-toolchain=/usr/gcc-4.8-clang-toolchain/ to match the ABI of the FTL
binary. That libstdc++ has no std::make_unique, whatever -std is used, so the two calls are
replaced by their plain equivalent. No change in behaviour.

--- a/apclient.hpp
+++ b/apclient.hpp
@@ -194 +194 @@
-            _autoDataPackageStore = std::make_unique<DefaultDataPackageStore>();
+            _autoDataPackageStore.reset(new DefaultDataPackageStore());
@@ -1704 +1704 @@
-            _ws = std::make_unique<WS>(_uri,
+            _ws.reset(new WS(_uri,
